==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*4 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*30 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] to win.

